        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 127030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nauczmy się, jak dodawać i usuwać wartości za pomocą tablic. Na przykładzie takiej aplikacji listy zadań, która używa tablicy do dodawania i usuwania zadań.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;To-Do List&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            background-color: #f5f5f5;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-container {&#xA;            background-color: white;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;        }&#xA;        h1 {&#xA;            font-size: 24px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 20px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;] {&#xA;            width: 20px;&#xA;            height: 20px;&#xA;            margin-right: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item.completed span {&#xA;            text-decoration: line-through;&#xA;            color: #ccc;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;todo-container&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1&gt;To-Dos&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-1&quot; checked&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy clear nail polish 💅&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-2&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy soap bar 🧼&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-3&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;paint soap with nail-polish&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-4&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;casually leave soap in bathroom&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-5&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;enjoy&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {&#xA;            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;]');&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                checkbox.addEventListener('change', function() {&#xA;                    if (this.checked) {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                    } else {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.remove('completed');&#xA;                    }&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                if (checkbox.checked) {&#xA;                    checkbox.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                }&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Push",
            "id": 127031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby dodać wartość taką jak <code>\"groceries\"</code> do tablicy w Swift, wpisz nazwę tablicy <code>toDo</code>, po której umieść kropkę <code>.</code>, a następnie metodę tablicy <code>append(\"groceries\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(toDo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;call mom&quot;, &quot;dishes&quot;, &quot;groceries&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>toDo</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>append(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "End of the array",
            "id": 127032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodanie wartości za pomocą metody <code>.append()</code> umieszcza ją na końcu tablicy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(toDo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;call mom&quot;, &quot;dishes&quot;, &quot;groceries&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 127033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W języku Swift możemy dodać wiele elementów do tablicy, używając operatora konkatenacji <code>+</code> oraz tablicy elementów, które chcemy dodać.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo += [\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(toDo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;call mom&quot;, &quot;dishes&quot;, &quot;groceries&quot;, &quot;feed cat&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Pop",
            "id": 127034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby usunąć ostatni element tablicy, wpisz nazwę tablicy <code>toDo</code>, kropkę <code>.</code> oraz metodę tablicy <code>removeLast()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.removeLast()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(toDo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;call mom&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>toDo</code>, następnie <code>.</code>, a potem <code>removeLast</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Store removed element",
            "id": 127035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy przypisujemy <code>toDo.removeLast()</code> do zmiennej, zmienna przechowuje wartość, którą usuwamy.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.removeLast()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(chore)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>chore</code>, a następnie <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
