            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak możemy zapisać wartość usuniętą przez <code>.removeLast()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Przechowując ją w zmiennej</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy tego zapisać, ponieważ <code>.removeLast()</code> nie zwraca wartości</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Przechowując ją w zmiennej.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 127041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"joe\"</code> do tablicy aktywnych użytkowników.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(activeUsers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".removeLast()\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;sue&quot;, &quot;mike&quot;, &quot;joe&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>activeUsers</code>, a następnie <code>.append(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the array",
            "id": 127042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"sugar\"</code> na końcu tablicy, kodując <code>.append(\"sugar\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(cookies)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"57\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;flour&quot;, &quot;butter&quot;, &quot;sugar&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.append(\"sugar\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: More values",
            "id": 127043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj na końcu tablicy najpierw <code>2</code>, a następnie <code>500</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" transactions = [-\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"transactions += [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(transactions)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[-100, 5, 2, 500]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>, a następnie <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Pop",
            "id": 127044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń wartość <code>true</code> z końca tablicy, używając <code>.removeLast()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ordersDelivered.removeLast()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(ordersDelivered)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ false, false ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.removeLast()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Store removed element",
            "id": 127045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń i wyświetl ostatnią wartość tablicy, tworząc zmienną i ustawiając jej wartość na <code>themes.removeLast()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" current = themes.removeLast()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(current)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dark mode\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>current</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>themes.removeLast()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
